THOUGHT: I’ll create the shared SQLite-backed service, three HTTP workers, standalone IRC gateway, supervisor, and SPA in one implementation. The design uses transactional per-channel event counters and polling so state and WebSocket/IRC delivery work across processes and survive Redis absence.

